    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d139">

                <pb facs="0535" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51 W 89 Roumania/17</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Rumanian Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nano</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <p>The Roumanian Chargé d’Affaires <hi rendition="#italic">ad interim</hi> presents
                    his compliments to the Secretary of State and pursuant to his note of October
                    18th, No. 4415/2,<anchor n="34" xml:id="d139-f1"/> has the honor to state that
                    his Government has designated Mr. Eftimie Antonesco, counsellor of the Roumanian
                    Supreme Court (Cour de Cassation), formerly technical delegate to the Paris
                    Conference and the conferences of Vienna and Rome, and Mr. Antoniade, formerly
                    Secretary General of the Ministry of Justice and now president of the Commission
                    for the Consolidation of Treasury Bonds in Paris, to conduct the proposed
                    negotiations concerning the indebtedness of Roumania to the United States, and
                    that they will shortly proceed to Washington.</p>
                <pb facs="0536" n="416" xml:id="pg416"/>
                <p>It appears, therefore, that Mr. Filitti’s appointment has been cancelled.<anchor
                        n="35" xml:id="d139-f2"/></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1922-10-20"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 20, 1922</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>No. 4446/2.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d139-f1" n="34" xml:id="d139-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d139-f2" n="35" xml:id="d139-f2-content">
                <p>The Rumanian Chargé in his note of Oct. 18 had stated that Mr. Filitti had been
                    designated to conduct the debt negotiations.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
